}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,X,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,X,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> (name, ground-model set, forcing, and order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NiceName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NiceName}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S\\)</span> (set-bounded canonical-name predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (set-function predicate and range operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(\\tau,x,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\}),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\nF(z)=\\{\\langle F(y),p\\rangle\\mid y\\in z\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\n\\tau=F(x)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(\\tau,x,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\}),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\nF(z)=\\{\\langle F(y),p\\rangle\\mid y\\in z\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\n\\tau=F(x)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NiceName}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\exists c\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,X,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(c(x),x,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\sigma\\subseteq\\{\\langle c(x),p\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle c(x),p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\land\\langle c(x),q\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\land p\\neq q\n\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NiceName}_S(\\sigma,X,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\exists c\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,X,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{CanonicalName}_S(c(x),x,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\sigma\\subseteq\\{\\langle c(x),p\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle c(x),p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\land\\langle c(x),q\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\land p\\neq q\n\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Canonical names are produced by a set function on the transitive closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\}\">\\(\\{x\\}\\)</span>, so the definition neither assumes a greatest forcing condition nor invokes an undeclared global <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check{\\cdot}\">\\(\\check{\\cdot}\\)</span> operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../b